{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Shujaa' is the Swahili word for hero. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an unnamed hero \u2014 an upright man, who decides to take down a dictator using dark voodoo to create a supernatural army to suppress the population and isolate the country.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is inspired by old school shooters. Its fast paced and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/extras/bc4517362ac91be36a1682202fe9508f.poster.avif?t=1774625352\" aria-label=\"Gameplay with minigun.\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/extras/bc4517362ac91be36a1682202fe9508f.webm?t=1774625352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/extras/bc4517362ac91be36a1682202fe9508f.mp4?t=1774625352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the level and sometimes in secret areas, you'll find weapons like shotguns, a bolt-action rifle, a rocket launcher, and even a minigun. Run out of ammo ? Well, it's machete time !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemy roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several enemy types. Some human, others supernatural. Although they use different types of attacks, they all have the same goal \u2014 to kill you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting levels some loosely inspired by real-life locations with secrets, ambushes, and environmental hazards. Find keys and switches to open doors and progress through the level.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909870?t=1774625352","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909870?t=1774625352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/79d989503bb6c5ae9f7e1121cccccfa4e120257d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774625352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/79d989503bb6c5ae9f7e1121cccccfa4e120257d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774625352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Enemies explode into low poly gibs when they die."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Shujaa' is the Swahili word for hero. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an unnamed hero \u2014 an upright man, who decides to take down a dictator using dark voodoo to create a supernatural army to suppress the population and isolate the country.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is inspired by old school shooters. Its fast paced and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/extras/bc4517362ac91be36a1682202fe9508f.poster.avif?t=1774625352\" aria-label=\"Gameplay with minigun.\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/extras/bc4517362ac91be36a1682202fe9508f.webm?t=1774625352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/extras/bc4517362ac91be36a1682202fe9508f.mp4?t=1774625352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the level and sometimes in secret areas, you'll find weapons like shotguns, a bolt-action rifle, a rocket launcher, and even a minigun. Run out of ammo ? Well, it's machete time !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemy roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several enemy types. Some human, others supernatural. Although they use different types of attacks, they all have the same goal \u2014 to kill you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting levels some loosely inspired by real-life locations with secrets, ambushes, and environmental hazards. Find keys and switches to open doors and progress through the level.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Knobthorn Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909870/31256b8d899b309d24a8f964edf1c1a2e226d498/header.jpg?t=1774625352","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3909870/1682080354/7e53314149ac78d77e99846